# CLI scratch state — machine-local (pooler URL, service versions), except the
# two files that identify the project. Keeping project-ref tracked matters:
# the CLI reads *that* file, not linked-project.json (which the MCP server
# writes), and without it every --linked command fails with
# "Cannot find project ref. Have you run supabase link?"
.temp/*
!.temp/project-ref
!.temp/linked-project.json
